msgid "# Layerwise and Sparse KV Cache Offloading Design"
msgstr "# 分层与稀疏KV缓存卸载设计"

msgid ""
"This document explains why Prefill and Decode use different KV cache offload\n"
"strategies, how the two strategies work, and how they preserve correctness when\n"
"used together."
msgstr "本文档解释了为什么Prefill和Decode使用不同的KV缓存卸载策略，这两种策略如何工作，以及它们一起使用时如何保持正确性。"

msgid ""
"For installation and configuration, see\n"
"[Layerwise and Sparse KV Cache Offloading Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/layerwise_and_sparse_kv_cache_offloading.md)."
msgstr ""
"有关安装和配置，请参阅\n"
"[分层与稀疏KV缓存卸载指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/layerwise_and_sparse_kv_cache_offloading.md)。"

msgid ""
"The design is based on\n"
"[RFC #48203](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48203)."
msgstr ""
"该设计基于\n"
"[RFC #48203](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48203)。"

msgid "## 1. Motivation"
msgstr "## 1. 动机"

msgid ""
"KV cache is a major NPU memory cost in long-sequence inference. Moving it to\n"
"host memory increases capacity, but Prefill and Decode cannot use the same\n"
"transfer strategy efficiently."
msgstr "KV缓存是长序列推理中NPU内存的主要开销。将其移动到主机内存可以增加容量，但Prefill和Decode无法高效地使用相同的传输策略。"

msgid "| Stage | Compute pattern | Offload strategy | NPU-resident data |"
msgstr "| 阶段 | 计算模式 | 卸载策略 | NPU驻留数据 |"

msgid ""
"| Prefill | High computation per layer | Transfer complete layers and "
"overlap transfer with computation | A few reusable layer buffers |"
msgstr "| Prefill | 每层计算量大 | 传输完整层并将传输与计算重叠 | 少量可复用的层缓冲区 |"

msgid ""
"| Decode | Low computation per token | Keep full KV in host memory and load "
"only selected entries | Indexer cache and per-layer hot top-k buffers |"
msgstr "| Decode | 每个token计算量小 | 将完整KV保留在主机内存中，仅加载选中的条目 | 索引器缓存和每层热top-k缓冲区 |"

msgid ""
"Loading a complete layer during every Decode step would add transfer latency\n"
"that cannot be hidden by Decode computation. Sparse Decode Offload avoids that\n"
"cost by moving only the entries selected by sparse attention."
msgstr ""
"在每一步Decode中加载完整层会增加传输延迟，而Decode计算无法隐藏这些延迟。稀疏Decode卸载通过仅移动稀疏注意力选中的条目来避免这一开销。"

msgid ""
"The following conceptual diagrams illustrate the difference. In Prefill, a\n"
"small number of complete-layer buffers are reused over time. In Decode, the\n"
"full main-KV history stays in host memory, while the full indexer cache and\n"
"sparse main-KV selections remain on the NPU. Device memory in the RFC figures\n"
"corresponds to NPU HBM in this implementation."
msgstr ""
"以下概念图说明了差异。在Prefill中，少量完整层缓冲区随时间被复用。在Decode中，完整的主KV历史保留在主机内存中，而完整的索引器缓存和稀疏主KV选择保留在NPU上。RFC图中的设备内存对应于本实现中的NPU"
" HBM。"

msgid ""
"*Layerwise Prefill Offload. Source: [RFC #48203](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm/issues/48203).*"
msgstr ""
"*分层Prefill卸载。来源：[RFC #48203](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm/issues/48203)。*"

msgid ""
"*Sparse Decode Offload. Source: [RFC #48203](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm/issues/48203).*"
msgstr ""
"*稀疏Decode卸载。来源：[RFC #48203](https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/vllm/issues/48203)。*"

msgid "## 2. System Overview"
msgstr "## 2. 系统概述"

msgid ""
"The production design targets disaggregated Prefill/Decode deployment. Hybrid\n"
"KV cache layouts are not currently supported. P/D colocation is limited to a\n"
"debug path and is not part of the supported production workflow."
msgstr "生产设计面向分离式Prefill/Decode部署。目前不支持混合KV缓存布局。P/D共置仅限于调试路径，不属于受支持的生产工作流。"

msgid "The combined design has four storage regions:"
msgstr "组合设计包含四个存储区域："

msgid ""
"- reusable layer buffers in Prefill NPU memory;\n"
"- the Memcache-backed Prefill host KV pool;\n"
"- the full main KV cache in Decode host memory; and\n"
"- the indexer cache and per-layer hot top-k buffers in Decode NPU memory."
msgstr ""
"- Prefill NPU内存中的可复用层缓冲区；\n"
"- 由Memcache支持的Prefill主机KV池；\n"
"- Decode主机内存中的完整主KV缓存；以及\n"
"- Decode NPU内存中的索引器缓存和每层热top-k缓冲区。"

msgid ""
"`AscendStoreConnector` manages Layerwise Prefill Offload through Memcache.\n"
"`SfaRemoteD2HConnector` exposes Prefill NPU buffers and lets Decode pull main KV\n"
"into Decode-owned host memory and indexer data into rank-local NPU memory\n"
"through MemFabric. Optional LIC8 scale data follows the indexer destination."
msgstr ""
"`AscendStoreConnector`通过Memcache管理分层Prefill卸载。\n"
"`SfaRemoteD2HConnector`暴露Prefill NPU缓冲区，让Decode通过MemFabric将主KV拉取到Decode拥有的主机内存中，并将索引器数据拉取到rank本地的NPU内存中。可选的LIC8缩放数据跟随索引器的目标位置。"

msgid "### Transfer granularity"
msgstr "### 传输粒度"

msgid ""
"The data path uses different transfer granularities according to when the\n"
"required addresses become known:"
msgstr "数据路径根据所需地址何时可知使用不同的传输粒度："

msgid "| Path | Granularity | Purpose |"
msgstr "| 路径 | 粒度 | 用途 |"

msgid ""
"| Prefill NPU to Decode host | Layer/block ranges | Populate Decode's full "
"main KV history |"
msgstr "| Prefill NPU到Decode主机 | 层/块范围 | 填充Decode的完整主KV历史 |"

msgid ""
"| Prefill NPU to Decode NPU | Block ranges within indexer/scale tensors | "
"Populate rank-local indexer and optional LIC8 scale data |"
msgstr "| Prefill NPU到Decode NPU | 索引器/缩放张量内的块范围 | 填充rank本地索引器和可选的LIC8缩放数据 |"

msgid ""
"| Decode current KV to Decode host | Token rows | Append newly generated KV "
"without a full NPU main cache |"
msgstr "| Decode当前KV到Decode主机 | Token行 | 追加新生成的KV，无需完整的NPU主缓存 |"

msgid ""
"| Decode host to Decode NPU | Top-k miss rows | Populate only missing "
"entries in the per-layer hot buffer |"
msgstr "| Decode主机到Decode NPU | Top-k未命中行 | 仅填充每层热缓冲区中缺失的条目 |"

msgid ""
"The Prefill transfers are known after each layer finishes and can be issued in\n"
"larger ranges. Decode miss addresses are known only after top-k selection and\n"
"residency lookup, so they use sparse token-row copies."
msgstr ""
"Prefill传输在每层完成后即可确定，可以以较大范围发出。Decode未命中地址仅在top-"
"k选择和驻留查找之后才可知，因此使用稀疏的token行复制。"

msgid "## 3. Layerwise Prefill Offload"
msgstr "## 3. 分层Prefill卸载"

msgid "### Buffer planning"
msgstr "### 缓冲区规划"

msgid ""
"Layerwise Prefill Offload maps many logical cache-bearing layers onto fewer\n"
"physical NPU buffers. Some layers can keep dedicated buffers; the remaining\n"
"compatible layers share a reusable buffer pool."
msgstr "分层Prefill卸载将许多承载缓存的逻辑层映射到更少的物理NPU缓冲区。某些层可以保留专用缓冲区；其余兼容的层共享一个可复用的缓冲区池。"

msgid "For a uniform cache layout:"
msgstr "对于统一的缓存布局："

msgid ""
"The footprint ratio assumes a uniform cache layout with equal-size layer\n"
"buffers. It describes only main-KV storage and does not include the indexer or\n"
"other fixed NPU allocations."
msgstr "占用率假设采用等大小层缓冲区的统一缓存布局。它仅描述主KV存储，不包括索引器或其他固定的NPU分配。"

msgid ""
"Reusable layers are assigned to the shared buffers in round-robin order.\n"
"Layers with incompatible main KV specifications do not share a physical\n"
"buffer. MTP layers participate in the same planning. Optional indexer caches\n"
"follow their main buffer assignment and are allocated only where needed."
msgstr ""
"可复用层按轮询顺序分配给共享缓冲区。主KV规格不兼容的层不共享物理缓冲区。MTP层参与相同的规划。可选的索引器缓存跟随其主缓冲区分配，仅在需要时分配。"

msgid ""
"Before tensor descriptors are merged, the planner validates cache\n"
"specifications, tensor sizes, and optional indexer layouts. An incompatible\n"
"layout fails initialization instead of sharing incorrectly sized storage."
msgstr "在合并张量描述符之前，规划器验证缓存规格、张量大小和可选的索引器布局。不兼容的布局会导致初始化失败，而不是共享大小错误的存储。"

msgid "### Execution pipeline"
msgstr "### 执行流水线"

msgid "For each layer:"
msgstr "对于每一层："

msgid ""
"1. load the cached prefix from Memcache when required;\n"
"2. wait until the target physical buffer is safe to overwrite;\n"
"3. run attention and update KV;\n"
"4. save the updated KV to host memory; and\n"
"5. prefetch a later layer while computation continues."
msgstr ""
"1. 需要时从Memcache加载缓存的prefix；\n"
"2. 等待目标物理缓冲区可以安全覆盖；\n"
"3. 运行attention并更新KV；\n"
"4. 将更新后的KV保存到主机内存；以及\n"
"5. 在计算继续时预取后续层。"

msgid ""
"Multiple physical buffers let transfer and computation overlap. Prefill has\n"
"enough per-layer computation to hide much of the load and save latency, which\n"
"is why full-layer transfer is suitable for this stage."
msgstr "多个物理缓冲区使传输和计算可以重叠。Prefill有足够的每层计算量来隐藏大部分加载和保存延迟，这就是为什么完整层传输适合此阶段。"

msgid "### Reuse invariant"
msgstr "### 复用不变量"

msgid ""
"A physical buffer cannot be reused until every consumer of its previous\n"
"contents has finished. Its Memcache save must complete before reuse. In the\n"
"joint deployment, the Decode-side remote read must also complete."
msgstr ""
"物理缓冲区在其先前内容的每个消费者完成之前不能被复用。其Memcache保存必须在复用前完成。在联合部署中，Decode侧的远程读取也必须完成。"

msgid ""
"The implementation tracks completion by physical storage slot rather than only\n"
"by logical layer name. This matters because several logical layers can refer to\n"
"the same NPU address."
msgstr "该实现按物理存储槽位而非仅按逻辑层名称跟踪完成状态。这一点很重要，因为多个逻辑层可能引用同一个NPU地址。"

msgid "## 4. Sparse Decode Offload"
msgstr "## 4. 稀疏解码卸载"

msgid "### Memory layout"
msgstr "### 内存布局"

msgid ""
"Sparse Decode Offload keeps the full main KV cache in a pinned Decode host\n"
"pool. Decode NPU memory contains:"
msgstr "稀疏解码卸载将完整的主KV缓存保存在固定的解码主机池中。解码NPU内存包含："

msgid ""
"- the rank-local indexer cache used to select important tokens; and\n"
"- per-layer K/V hot buffers containing recently selected main-KV entries for\n"
"  active Decode rows."
msgstr ""
"- 用于选择重要令牌的秩本地索引器缓存；以及\n"
"- 每层K/V热缓冲区，包含活动解码行最近选中的主KV条目。"

msgid ""
"Each Decode DP rank owns a separate main host pool. Within one DP rank, its TP\n"
"ranks share that pool, while every TP rank owns the indexer data required by its\n"
"local attention computation. Control-plane ports are assigned as\n"
"`kv_port + dp_rank * d_tp_size + tp_rank`, keeping DP and TP endpoints disjoint."
msgstr ""
"每个解码DP秩拥有独立的主机池。在一个DP秩内，其TP秩共享该池，而每个TP秩拥有其本地注意力计算所需的索引器数据。控制面端口按`kv_port + "
"dp_rank * d_tp_size + tp_rank`分配，确保DP和TP端点互不重叠。"

msgid "### Decode step"
msgstr "### 解码步骤"

msgid "For each Decode step:"
msgstr "对于每个解码步骤："

msgid ""
"1. Decode generates the new-token K/V without writing it to a full NPU paged\n"
"   main cache;\n"
"2. the new K/V rows are copied to their logical slots in the shared host pool;\n"
"3. the indexer selects logical top-k token positions;\n"
"4. the per-layer LRU residency table identifies hits, assigns physical hot\n"
"   buffer slots to misses, and selects eviction slots when necessary;\n"
"5. only miss rows are copied from host memory to the NPU;\n"
"6. logical top-k positions are remapped to physical hot-buffer slots; and\n"
"7. sparse attention consumes the resident K/V while residency metadata is\n"
"   retained for the next step."
msgstr ""
"1. 解码生成新令牌的K/V，但不将其写入完整的NPU分页主缓存；\n"
"2. 新的K/V行被复制到共享主机池中的逻辑槽位；\n"
"3. 索引器选择逻辑top-k令牌位置；\n"
"4. 每层LRU驻留表识别命中项，为未命中项分配物理热缓冲区槽位，并在必要时选择驱逐槽位；\n"
"5. 仅将未命中的行从主机内存复制到NPU；\n"
"6. 逻辑top-k位置被重新映射到物理热缓冲区槽位；以及\n"
"7. 稀疏注意力消费驻留的K/V，同时保留驻留元数据以供下一步使用。"

msgid ""
"With tensor parallelism, Decode-produced K/V is replicated. TP rank 0 allocates\n"
"the shared host pool and writes the new-token rows. All TP ranks access that\n"
"allocation through the broadcast global virtual addresses provided by the\n"
"MemFabric offload path."
msgstr ""
"在张量并行下，解码生成的K/V会被复制。TP秩0分配共享主机池并写入新令牌行。所有TP秩通过MemFabric卸载路径提供的广播全局虚拟地址访问该分配。"

msgid ""
"The full history remains available in host memory, but transfer volume is\n"
"proportional to top-k misses rather than total sequence length. This makes\n"
"offload practical for the low-compute Decode stage."
msgstr "完整历史记录仍保留在主机内存中，但传输量仅与top-k未命中数成正比，而非总序列长度。这使得卸载对低计算量的解码阶段切实可行。"

msgid "## 5. Joint Prefill and Decode Design"
msgstr "## 5. 联合预填充与解码设计"

msgid "### Connector composition"
msgstr "### 连接器组合"

msgid ""
"Prefill uses `MultiConnector` to compose the Remote D2H completion provider and\n"
"`AscendStoreConnector`. `AscendMultiConnector` invokes the completion provider\n"
"first regardless of their order in the connector configuration. For every\n"
"layer buffer:"
msgstr ""
"预填充使用`MultiConnector`组合远程D2H完成提供程序和`AscendStoreConnector`。无论连接器配置中的顺序如何，`AscendMultiConnector`都会首先调用完成提供程序。对于每个层缓冲区："

msgid ""
"- AscendStore saves the layer to the Prefill host KV pool; and\n"
"- Remote D2H publishes source metadata and waits for Decode acknowledgements."
msgstr ""
"- AscendStore将层保存到预填充主机KV池；以及\n"
"- 远程D2H发布源元数据并等待解码确认。"

msgid ""
"The buffer-reuse gate opens only after both paths finish. This prevents Prefill\n"
"from overwriting a shared physical buffer while Decode is still reading it."
msgstr "缓冲区重用门仅在两条路径都完成后才打开。这防止预填充在解码仍在读取共享物理缓冲区时覆盖它。"

msgid "### Request flow"
msgstr "### 请求流程"

msgid ""
"1. Decode allocates its main host destination and rank-local indexer\n"
"   destination.\n"
"2. Decode advertises its endpoint and parallel topology through the proxy\n"
"   metaserver.\n"
"3. Prefill computes the request layer by layer.\n"
"4. After each layer's KV write completes, Prefill starts the Memcache save and\n"
"   publishes Remote D2H readiness.\n"
"5. Decode pulls the layer into its destinations and acknowledges completion.\n"
"6. Prefill releases the physical buffer for reuse after all required\n"
"   completions arrive.\n"
"7. Decode schedules the request only after the full request reaches a terminal\n"
"   transfer state across all required ranks."
msgstr ""
"1. 解码分配其主主机目标和秩本地索引器目标。\n"
"2. 解码通过代理元服务器通告其端点和并行拓扑。\n"
"3. 预填充逐层计算请求。\n"
"4. 每层KV写入完成后，预填充启动Memcache保存并发布远程D2H就绪状态。\n"
"5. 解码将层拉取到其目标并确认完成。\n"
"6. 预填充在所有必需完成通知到达后释放物理缓冲区以供重用。\n"
"7. 解码仅在完整请求在所有必需秩上达到终止传输状态后才调度该请求。"

msgid "Physical-buffer completion and request completion are separate:"
msgstr "物理缓冲区完成和请求完成是分开的："

msgid ""
"- physical-buffer completion protects Prefill memory reuse; and\n"
"- request completion controls when Decode may begin inference."
msgstr ""
"- 物理缓冲区完成保护预填充内存重用；以及\n"
"- 请求完成控制解码何时可以开始推理。"

msgid "## 6. Unequal Tensor Parallelism"
msgstr "## 6. 非均匀张量并行"

msgid "The supported joint topology is:"
msgstr "支持的联合拓扑为："

msgid "For Prefill rank `p_rank`:"
msgstr "对于预填充秩`p_rank`："

msgid "The Prefill ranks mapped to one Decode rank form a contributor group."
msgstr "映射到同一个解码秩的预填充秩构成一个贡献组。"

msgid ""
"- Main KV is replicated on Prefill, so only contributor member `0` transfers\n"
"  the main share owned by that Decode rank.\n"
"- Contributors transfer disjoint indexer ranges whose union forms the complete\n"
"  rank-local Decode indexer.\n"
"- A contributor with no blocks still acknowledges the layer so completion\n"
"  cannot deadlock."
msgstr ""
"- 主KV在预填充上被复制，因此只有贡献成员`0`传输该解码秩拥有的主份额。\n"
"- 贡献者传输互不重叠的索引器范围，其并集构成完整的秩本地解码索引器。\n"
"- 没有块的贡献者仍会确认该层，以免完成过程发生死锁。"

msgid "## 7. Validation and Failure Handling"
msgstr "## 7. 验证与故障处理"

msgid ""
"Before a Remote D2H read, Decode validates main tensor count and sizes, indexer\n"
"presence and sizes, optional LIC8 scale layout, and destination block ranges.\n"
"A mismatch fails the layer instead of leaving partially valid destination\n"
"data."
msgstr ""
"在远程D2H读取之前，解码验证主张量数量和大小、索引器的存在和大小、可选的LIC8缩放布局以及目标块范围。任何不匹配都会使该层失败，而不会留下部分有效的目标数据。"

msgid ""
"After Decode processes a readiness notification, it replies with `READ_DONE` or\n"
"`READ_FAILED`. A reported MemFabric read failure invalidates the Decode\n"
"destination and releases the Prefill-side waiter with an error, preventing\n"
"silent corruption. A lost acknowledgement or stopped Decode process is not\n"
"treated as a terminal state, so Prefill may continue waiting."
msgstr ""
"解码处理就绪通知后，会以`READ_DONE`或`READ_FAILED`回复。报告的MemFabric读取失败会使解码目标失效，并以错误释放预填充端的等待者，防止静默损坏。丢失确认或解码进程停止不被视为终止状态，因此预填充可以继续等待。"

msgid "## 8. Current Boundaries"
msgstr "## 8. 当前限制"

msgid ""
"- Layerwise shared-buffer offload requires the Memcache backend and eager mode.\n"
"- Sparse Decode Offload requires Model Runner V1 and an SFA/MLA sparse-attention\n"
"  model. The main KV cache must use BF16; LIC8 quantization is supported only\n"
"  for the device-resident indexer cache.\n"
"- Hybrid KV cache layouts are not supported.\n"
"- Sparse Decode Offload supports DP and TP; CP and PP are not supported.\n"
"- Joint deployment requires Prefill TP to be greater than or equal to, and\n"
"  divisible by, Decode TP.\n"
"- MemFabric is the only supported Remote D2H transfer backend.\n"
"- Layerwise buffer reuse cannot currently be combined with\n"
"  `MooncakeLayerwiseConnector` because it does not provide a per-buffer transfer\n"
"  completion gate. Support is planned in a follow-up update.\n"
"- Connector-level data-read retry is not implemented."
msgstr ""
"- 逐层共享缓冲区卸载需要Memcache后端和eager模式。\n"
"- 稀疏解码卸载需要Model Runner V1和SFA/MLA稀疏注意力模型。主KV缓存必须使用BF16；LIC8量化仅支持设备驻留的索引器缓存。\n"
"- 不支持混合KV缓存布局。\n"
"- 稀疏解码卸载支持DP和TP；不支持CP和PP。\n"
"- 联合部署要求预填充TP大于或等于解码TP，且能被解码TP整除。\n"
"- MemFabric是唯一支持的远程D2H传输后端。\n"
"- 逐层缓冲区重用目前无法与`MooncakeLayerwiseConnector`结合使用，因为它不提供逐缓冲区传输完成门。计划在后续更新中提供支持。\n"
"- 未实现连接器级别的数据读取重试。"

msgid ""
"The MemFabric data path is selected at launch through\n"
"`kv_connector_extra_config[\"memfabric_transfer_protocol\"]` instead of hardware\n"
"detection: `sdma` (default) and `device_rdma` target A3 series nodes, while\n"
"`device_urma` targets A5 series nodes. Prefill and Decode must use the same\n"
"protocol."
msgstr ""
"MemFabric 数据路径在启动时通过\n"
"`kv_connector_extra_config[\"memfabric_transfer_protocol\"]` 选择，而非硬件检测：\n"
"`sdma`（默认）和 `device_rdma` 针对 A3 系列节点，而\n"
"`device_urma` 针对 A5 系列节点。Prefill 和 Decode 必须使用相同的协议。"
